course: dictionary
lesson: 15292
title: Sixteenth: order or a part
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Sixteenth is an order word, like first, second and third. It tells you the place in a list. «She finished the race in sixteenth place» means she came 16th.
explain: Sixteenth can also be a fraction. If you cut a whole into sixteen equal parts, each part is one sixteenth, written 1/16. «Mum cut the pizza into sixteen equal parts, so each slice was one sixteenth of the pizza.»
explain: Check the meaning by asking: is this a place in order, or one part of a whole? Swap in your meaning. If «sixteenth place» still makes sense as 16th, it is order. If «one sixteenth of the pizza» still makes sense as one part of sixteen, it is a fraction.
fact: «Sixteenth» means number 16 in order.
fact: «A sixteenth» is one of sixteen equal parts of a whole, written 1/16.
fact: Sixteen sixteenths make one whole.
fact: In music, a sixteenth note (also called a semiquaver) is a short note.
fact: Sixteen is the number 16, and sixteenth is the same number used as an order word.
exercise: «She finished the race in sixteenth place.» Which number is this? | 1 | 60 | 6 | *16
exercise: «Mum cut the pizza into sixteen equal parts.» Each slice is what fraction of the pizza? | 1/60 | 16 slices | *1/16 | 1/6
exercise: Ben says a sixteenth is the same as sixteen. Is he right? | Yes, a sixteenth is a whole cake | *No, a sixteenth is one of sixteen equal parts, written 1/16 | No, a sixteenth is a type of ruler | Yes, it is the same number
test: «Maya's sixteenth birthday was on Saturday.» What does sixteenth mean here? | One sixteenth of a birthday cake | *The 16th birthday in order | A birthday with only one candle | Sixteen birthdays at once
test: Which of these is written as a fraction for one sixteenth? | 6/16 | 1/6 | 16/1 | *1/16
exam: Lena says, «I am sixteenth in the line.» What does sixteenth mean? | Sixteen people at once | The first person in the line | *Number 16 in order | One of sixteen equal parts
